<main class="pc" data-product-contact="2"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / Contact</p><h1>联系我们。</h1><p class="pc-lead">预约、培训、合作及一般咨询。</p><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-contact"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS</p><h2>ROOT FRONTIER SYSTEMS</h2><a class="pc-link" href="mailto:rootfrontier.office@gmail.com">rootfrontier.office@gmail.com</a><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../your-cranium/">Personal Navigator</a></div></div><div class="pc-card"><form data-contact-product action="https://formsubmit.co/rootfrontier.office@gmail.com" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="CRANIO SYSTEMS — website enquiry"><label for="contact-name">姓名</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required><label for="contact-email">您的电子邮箱</label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required><label for="contact-topic">主题</label><select id="contact-topic" name="topic"><option>预约</option><option>培训</option><option>技术与合作</option><option>其他咨询</option></select><label for="contact-message">留言</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="message" maxlength="3000" required></textarea><p class="pc-note">FormSubmit → rootfrontier.office@gmail.com. 请勿填写诊断、医疗文件或其他机密信息。</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="submit">发送</button><button class="contact-fallback" type="button" data-contact-draft hidden>打开邮件草稿</button></div><p role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><script type="application/json" data-contact-strings>["发送中…","服务已接收请求。我们将通过电子邮件回复。","未确认送达，已填写的信息仍保留在表单中。您可以打开邮件草稿并自行发送。"]</script></form></div></div></section></main>